  "text": "This automation syncs supplier inventory levels with your store every 15 minutes. Dropshipping gets chaotic when winning products suddenly sell out at the supplier without warning. Relying on manual spreadsheet checks leaves massive blind spots where out-of-stock orders slip through. Instead, connect your supplier CSV feed to Shopify using Zapier to auto-zero listings the instant stock drops. You protect your profit margins effortlessly.",
